     A catalogue to start from, not a closed list: the client extends it from
     Website > Configuration > Facilities and services.

     Written in English on purpose. Odoo keeps en_US as the technical base of
     every translatable column, so a record seeded in Spanish has its Spanish
     sitting in the base, exactly where an English translation later lands on
     top of it. That is how 2134 records lost their Spanish on 2026-08-14.
     English here, Spanish in i18n/es.po, and nothing can overwrite anything.

     noupdate: renaming an item is the client's to do, and a module update must
     not undo it. -->
